BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY ACADEMIC POLICIES - SECTION 1.0: GRADING SCALE AND DEFINITIONS. Course letter grades carry the following numerical grade point equivalents: A = 4.0, A- = 3.7, B+ = 3.3, B = 3.0, B- = 2.7, C+ = 2.3, C = 2.0, D = 1.0, F = 0.0. An Incomplete \(I\) grade must be resolved by the end of the 8th week of the subsequent term; otherwise, the registrar converts it automatically to an F.) Tj ET
