BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY GRADING POLICY - SECTION 3.4: FORMAL GRADE APPEAL PROCEDURE. A student who believes a final semester grade was calculated erroneously or arbitrarily must first confer informally with the course instructor within 7 calendar days of grade publication. If unresolved, the student must submit a Formal Written Grade Appeal to the Department Chair within 14 calendar days of final grade publication. The Department Chair convenes an Academic Review Committee whose written determination is binding.) Tj ET
endstream
