stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY ACADEMIC STANDARDS - SECTION 4.1: PROBATION AND COURSE RETAKE POLICY. Any student whose cumulative grade point average drops below 2.00 is placed on Academic Probation for the following semester. While on probation, a student may register for a maximum of 13 credit hours and cannot participate in intercollegiate athletics. Course Retake Policy: A student may repeat a course in which a grade of C- or lower was earned. A course may be repeated a maximum of two times \(three total attempts\).) Tj ET
endstream
